@GooseWebsite_HostAddress = https://localhost:8889

### Public: published blog posts (search, category, page, pageSize are optional)
GET {{GooseWebsite_HostAddress}}/api/blog?page=1&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

### Public: one published post by slug
GET {{GooseWebsite_HostAddress}}/api/blog/example-slug
Accept: application/json

### Auth: fetch an antiforgery request token (sets the CSRF cookie). Send it as X-CSRF-TOKEN on every POST below.
GET {{GooseWebsite_HostAddress}}/api/auth/csrf

### Auth: sign in (non-persistent cookie session)
POST {{GooseWebsite_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <requestToken from /api/auth/csrf>

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "<password>" }

### Auth: current session
GET {{GooseWebsite_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Contact: submit the form (returns verification-pending; nothing is delivered yet)
POST {{GooseWebsite_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Example",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "reason": "Work or collaboration",
  "message": "Hello Gustavo.",
  "website": ""
}

### Contact: confirm the sender's email and deliver the message
GET {{GooseWebsite_HostAddress}}/api/contact/verify?token=<token>
